					"nextDialogs": [
						761180504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180504,
					"content": "（她真的睁眼了！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180505,
					"content": "（平时说顺嘴了…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761180506,
					"content": "好美。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180507,
					"content": "这对翅膀，让它显得更完整了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180508,
					"content": "这是我等「霜月之子」送给哥伦比娅你的礼物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180509,
					"content": "庆祝我们的神明从此能够自由翱翔，她的指尖终于触碰到了「家」的所在。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180510,
					"content": "…从前的我看到这神像，只会浮现出自己出生时迷茫的心情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180511,
					"content": "现在，我感受到的则是「家」的温暖。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180512,
					"content": "或许就像这尊雕像，尽管已经拥有了翅膀，但我依旧选择于此处栖身。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180513,
					"content": "…谢谢你们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180514,
					"content": "除此之外，还有一份礼物，不过需要跟着我多走一段路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180515,
					"content": "欸？还有惊喜吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180516,
					"content": "我和同胞们在林中筹办了一场简单的欢迎宴会。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180517,
					"content": "哥伦比娅，从今往后，这里也将成为你的家园。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180518,
					"content": "当你想家的时候，就请你安心留下来，多喝几杯粗茶吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180519,
					"content": "好呀，我会的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180520,
					"content": "正好，月亮升起来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180521
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761180521,
					"content": "我们走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180522,
					"content": "希望每一个夜晚，都同那日的祈月之夜一样美好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761180523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 761180523,
					"content": "欢迎回家，哥伦比娅。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				}
